{"claim_hash": "fa8c2fd7bf710c105bba5f5a48e0a366d10f43ab3c3db12813556c19942d882e", "claim": "In 1937 a defrocked English priest named Harold Davidson was mauled to death by a lion in a sideshow at Skegness. He had spent five years protesting his innocence after a scandal stripped him of his church, exhibiting himself in a barrel on Blackpool seafront and finally re-enacting Daniel in the Lions' Den live in a cage with two lions. The lions did not play along.", "topic": "history", "category": "REEL", "post_id": "21f827c2754169", "ig_media_id": "18103983716497930", "published_at": "2026-05-04T07:57:18.959364Z", "sources": []}
